OL,3,GNEWSACivil War sieges dragged ordinary
OL,4,Afolk into war, says curator
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese included Woodcroft Castle, just
OL,7,Fnorth of Peterborough, which is still
OL,8,Fsaid to be haunted by Charles I's
OL,9,Fchaplain, who was hacked to death at
OL,10,Fthe battle's end.
